                        "entry_id": "12722dfd-f52a-3988-8d2b-2cc7fb7fa78e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A grieving male lover."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "India"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f117614-e4f7-44cb-9e83-fe31438511a0",
                                "sense_id": "dd92d269-5571-3490-be58-2c90edfb4ae7",
                                "text": "\"I don't know,\" he had said and sighed, Devdas style: \"I don't know,\" Everyone wants to be a Devdas, at least for a while — or perhaps only for a while. Tragic hero."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d326035-3e09-4de7-ba6d-b5a4552dc96c",
                                "sense_id": "dd92d269-5571-3490-be58-2c90edfb4ae7",
                                "text": "It reminds me very much of the Devdas character that so suffuses Indian cinema, not just in the 1935 and 1955 film versions, but as a 'Devdas effect' in Hindi melodramas, especially those of Raj Kapoor and Guru Dutt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "167b07ec-bbed-4154-9f71-be1660275651",
                                "sense_id": "dd92d269-5571-3490-be58-2c90edfb4ae7",
                                "text": "Indians everywhere recognized that when somebody pined, longed, and raged for someone else, they were \"doing a Devdas.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "26977fed-fd29-4e18-917b-d5a0c56d683f",
                                "sense_id": "dd92d269-5571-3490-be58-2c90edfb4ae7",
                                "text": "The character of Kashyap's Dev, although it is built on the same model as traditional Devdases, is different and suffers for other reasons."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
